        "stance": "condition",
        "stance_id": "stance_t2_condition_00",
        "text": "The test question is: if Merck offered you a role that was a lateral move content-wise, still the same portfolio work you do now but with a commute, would you take it? If yes, it's genuinely a career-leverage move. If no, some of what's pulling you is the dissatisfaction, not the opportunity.",
